<BaseLayout title="Support">
  <h1>Support</h1>

  <p>
    Support is where we gather the information people may need in moments of
    urgency or uncertainty. This includes crisis contacts, specialist services,
    and signposts across the UK, Australia, New Zealand, and North America.
  </p>

  <p>
    Identity Partners is a relational practice, but we know that people
    sometimes need immediate support or specialist services alongside the work
    they do with us. This section exists to make those pathways clear,
    accessible, and human.
  </p>

  <ul>
    <li><a href="/support/emergency">Emergency Support</a></li>
  </ul>
</BaseLayout>
